{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_11_level_main_11-07_end",
  "groupId": "main_11",
  "stageId": "main_11-07",
  "title": "停滞",
  "storyCode": "11-8",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_11-07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "817df4cf060b54716073b39815a6ca87b1f08b265664d1d38602553431e97d94",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "又追上来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救军战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_398_1",
      "text": "您......您先走吧，您这样的身份，不该为了我们陷入危险......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "要是带队的人是阿勒黛或者克洛维希娅，你也会急着说这样的话吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救军战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_398_1",
      "text": "......您不一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "低头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救军战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_398_1",
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "锤子在推进之王手上转了半圈，擦着自救军战士的头顶重重落下。\n伴随着砖头碎裂的声响，墙上出现了一个巨大的深坑。一同陷在碎砖块里的，还有一名萨卡兹术师拿着法杖的手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "......是不一样，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救军战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_398_1",
      "text": "您......您......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "跟上我。我不怎么习惯在战场上等人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "......还没甩开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救军战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_398_1",
      "text": "这群萨卡兹也太难对付了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "虽然制服一样，但萨迪恩区的那些萨卡兹士兵跟他们一比，就跟杂牌军差不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "他们不一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救军战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_398_1",
      "text": "那我们该怎么办？在街上兜圈子有用吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "你以前是坐办公室的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救军战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_398_1",
      "text": "啊？是、是的，我以前是会计......怎么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "那你以前都怎么出门的？坐车？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救军战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_398_1",
      "text": "呃，没错......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "你知不知道伦蒂尼姆的巷子一般是什么宽窄，从威灵顿街的一头到另一头要跑多久，每个街区分别有几个下水道入口？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救军战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_398_1",
      "text": "......不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "她们知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救军战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_398_1",
      "text": "谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "text": "维娜，这里！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "text": "发现目标！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "text": "还有敌人躲在暗处！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "text": "......维娜，走这边！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "安全屋那里有爆炸声。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "自救军的动作还不够快，我们得掩护他们撤退。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "text": "啧，换这条路！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "达格达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "text": "推进之王！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "达格达，自救军的情况怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "达格达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "text": "克洛维希娅指挥官带着大部分人撤出去了。阿勒黛小姐她......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "......唔，我没事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "阿勒黛，你受伤了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "我能处理好自己的麻烦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "殿下，你不该回来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "text": "他们都藏在里面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "text": "剿灭他们，格杀勿论。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "达格达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "text": "恕我直言，推进之王，我还是觉得你不该......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "......你也觉得我不该折返？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "达格达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "text": "不，你不该在任何时候都想着站在最前面挡住敌人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "达格达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "text": "有些时刻，请容许我站在你的身侧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "好。上前来，达格达。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "阿勒黛，你应该休息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "坎伯兰公爵的女儿可不能输给曼彻斯特伯爵的女儿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "我更熟悉阿勒黛和达格达。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "那么，作为你的朋友阿勒黛，我同样会与你并肩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "你呢，战士？你还能站起来吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救军战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_398_1",
      "text": "我......我可以......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "那就握紧你的武器，过来一起战斗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "伦蒂尼姆......这片钢铁丛林属于我们。是时候让萨卡兹知道谁才是猎物了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "text": "你的身份救不了你，阿斯兰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "text": "我们不在乎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "text": "萨卡兹的明天已经来了，而你们，就该被埋葬在过去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "text": "等等......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "text": "全体注意，货架后面有埋伏！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "你很敏锐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "text": "来，转过来，看这边。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "text": "错了，该看这边。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "达格达",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "text": "推进之王，动手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救军战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_398_1",
      "text": "小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "text": "很花哨，也很无聊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "text": "玩闹结束了，诸位。放下武器，如果你们还想死得轻松些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "text": "这样，我们彼此都能痛快一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "......不好意思，我疏忽了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "不用跟我道歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "萨卡兹看着推进之王，而推进之王看着阿勒黛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她慢慢抬起双手。砰一声响，锤子落地。\n她朝阿勒黛眨了眨眼。阿勒黛微微扬起嘴角。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "text": "等等......风？这可是室内......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "是...\n...该死，是源石技艺！还击！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "维娜，接好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "text": "呃——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "你还好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "至少心情很不错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "text": "这仓库要塌了，撤出来！在外面包围他们！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "text": "唔，你们的“安全屋”看来不太结实。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "安全屋不一定是一座永不陷落的城堡，朋友们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "——跟我来，走这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "暗道应该已经被倒塌的房子封死了，但我们也要加快速度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "你得包扎下伤口，阿勒黛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "我、我没事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "达格达，你们送这位战士回自救军营地吧，我们分头走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救军战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_398_1",
      "text": "殿......推进之王。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救军战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_398_1",
      "text": "你是个够意思的领袖。嘿，下次也要让你看看咱们自救军的本事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救军战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_398_1",
      "text": "谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "text": "你打算去哪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "阿勒黛的伤势不能耽搁，我会就近......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "等等，我对这里有印象......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "维娜，你居然还记得这条小道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "那个你和他们带着“诸王之息”归来的下午。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "......什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "......没什么，往前走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "这是从王宫通向公爵府的路，知道的人并不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "我收到了某位阁下的保证，明天之前，坎伯兰公爵府还是安全的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "足够我们处理好这点小伤了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "......维娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "你知道我在？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "我很清楚自己房间外面应该有哪些动静。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "你再怎么盯着看，我背上的伤也不会自己愈合，亲爱的维娜小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "能不能麻烦你帮我换下药？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "......好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "抱歉，我是不是下手太重了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "没事，不是什么大伤。只是好不容易没那么多双眼睛盯着，一下子没忍住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "明明流了那么多血......你过去是不是受过很多伤？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "放心，大多早就不疼了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "要是今天我的反应能更快一些的话......也许你就不用再添一道伤疤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "能从刚刚那些士兵手底下逃脱，已经很不容易了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "而且，这几天我一直很想找机会说声谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "你帮了自救军很多忙。你还替我保住了那具古老的蒸汽甲胄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "这是我该做的，阿勒黛。我......我不想看着你失去更多东西了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "这没什么，维娜。这些年我早就明白了一个道理，那就是大部分事情都无法如我们所愿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "要不然的话，此时此刻，我们根本不会躲在这个阴暗的小房间里，边上也不会是一堆臭烘烘的绷带。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "我们......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "让我想想......我们会坐在花园里，一边喝茶一边聊聊诗歌和天气吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "对了，也可以去打猎。这个季节的伦蒂尼姆城郊有许多大角兽，它们跑得很快，面对人群的时候却喜欢发呆。你喜欢打猎吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "......我不确定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "嗯，其实我也快忘了。但我猜你不喜欢跳舞，至少不会喜欢社交季那些冗长的舞会。我也不喜欢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "那些裙子远远没有猎装方便，又勒得慌，容易影响宴会上的胃口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "哈哈，我能想象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "而且......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "你想说什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "我在想，猎装一定更适合你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "......维娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "或许......我们本该在许多场合许多时间相遇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "命运罔顾我们的意愿，夺走了可能很美好的过去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "好在，我们还有将来......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "怎么了？你看起来很惊讶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "......我竟然在谈论将来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "这对你来说很不常见吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "在那些逃亡的日子里，我很少想到以后会怎么样。过去都在梦中，而将来......将来陷在雾里，我什么都看不见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "......维娜，这并非你的缺憾，而是你的优点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "庸俗的贵族们都爱谈论明天，大多数人却更关心今天的餐桌上能有什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "不是生活令他们麻木，而是他们更懂得此时此刻有多么可贵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "就像此时此刻？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "是的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "就像此时此刻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "艾尔希。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家艾尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_658_1",
      "text": "早安，阿勒黛小姐，东西都已经收拾好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "蒸汽甲胄......你怎么把它搬出来了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "目标太大，我们没法带走它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家艾尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_658_1",
      "text": "......是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家艾尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_658_1",
      "text": "亚历山德莉娜殿下已经离开了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "嗯，她还有她的任务。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家艾尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_658_1",
      "text": "您的伤......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "已经没有大碍了，多亏了殿下的帮助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家艾尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_658_1",
      "text": "......小姐，我很久没有见您像这样微笑了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "哈哈，大战在即，我是不是太放松了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "与殿下她们并肩站在一起......确实让我有了些久违的感觉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "能交付信任的人，对于我而言，已经很久很久没有遇到过了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家艾尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_658_1",
      "text": "亚历山德莉娜殿下还帮您留住了这具甲胄，我虽然只是区区管家，但我仍念她的恩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家艾尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_658_1",
      "text": "这是坎伯兰家的荣耀所在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "荣耀......吗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家艾尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_658_1",
      "text": "这具甲胄与您伟大的先祖......我还记得，您小时候经常与他们说话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "小孩子总是容易沉溺于幻想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "但起码我在二十六年前就明白了，它并不是什么英雄，就只是个坏了的笨重的铁疙瘩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "我们都变了样，这具甲胄却像是被冻在了时间里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "你......很喜欢亚历山德莉娜殿下吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家艾尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_658_1",
      "text": "殿下是一个温柔的人。我见过她是如何对待她的同伴的。她们吃一样的东西，住一样的房间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家艾尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_658_1",
      "text": "她不像大多数贵族，不把她们看作低贱的仆从，更不会抛下她们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "维多利亚很幸运。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "我们的殿下有一颗强大的心，颠沛流离的苦难并未磨灭她的正直与赤诚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家艾尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_658_1",
      "text": "您只说维多利亚......那您呢？阿勒黛小姐，您怎么看待那位殿下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "我希望她有一个光辉的将来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家艾尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_658_1",
      "text": "那您......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "昨夜，我又收到了信。一天之内的第二封。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "她......很心急。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家艾尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_658_1",
      "text": "可是，您明明已经与殿下重逢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家艾尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_658_1",
      "text": "您还记得二十六年前吗？殿下带着诸王之息来到这里，那一定是某种预兆，或许很快就会应验！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家艾尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_658_1",
      "text": "我们已经等了那么久，小姐，您可以......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "他......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "艾尔希，我早就不再等待了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "吉姆离开了多久了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家艾尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_658_1",
      "text": "出事之后第二年，他就辞职回到了半岛郡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "......二十五年。我们的家里......有二十五年没有园丁了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "我从小就很喜欢长在那边的灌木。它时不时会绊倒我，可开出来的花是金色的，小小的，非常漂亮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "吉姆走了以后的那个冬天，最初的那一批全都死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "妈妈到处托人去找新的种子，才发现原来它是米诺斯最名贵的品种。买下那些种子的钱足够一个伦蒂尼姆的普通家庭生活足足五年。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家艾尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_658_1",
      "text": "就算失去了某一种灌木，您的花园也依然美丽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "我努力过了，艾尔希。我们都很努力。为了让花园保持整洁，无论是寒冬还是盛夏，你都不停地在这里劳作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "可没有了那些名贵的种子......我们的花园再也回不到最美丽的样子了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "在爸爸去世后的第五个新年，我给她寄了一封信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "她的回信里，附带着坎伯兰家早已负担不起的花种。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "所以艾尔希，我们只是......一直都是这么生活的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家艾尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_658_1",
      "text": "公爵大人要是在这里的话......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "......她总有很多手段。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家艾尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_658_1",
      "text": "不，小姐，我在说您的父亲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "父亲......父亲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "我都快想不起来他的声音了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "也许只有站在这花园里，我才能......才能勉强回忆起他如何握着我的手，教我挥剑，将我击倒，又把我抱起来，让我坐在他的肩膀上......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "很多年以前，我曾想要把它们留下来。艾尔希，我用尽了一切方法。花园，甲胄......还有爸爸的影子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "可是，“想要”最廉价。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "我还记得，我小时候还想要成为蒸汽骑士呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "艾尔希，很偶尔很偶尔，我会想......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "长大实在是一件残忍的事，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "除开那些最好运的家伙，我们最终只会成为一个个疲惫又庸常的大人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "小心翼翼，言不由衷，在浪潮下尽可能抓住一点救命稻草，然后再也不松手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "艾尔希，在你小的时候，你想成为什么？绝不是某个没落人家的管家，对吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家艾尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_658_1",
      "text": "不，能陪在您身边我很荣幸......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "别骗我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家艾尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_658_1",
      "text": "唔，也许......我小时候听了很多吟游诗人的故事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "嘿，吟游诗人艾尔希。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家艾尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_658_1",
      "text": "您别捉弄我了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "然后，成长这件事，就是把我们小时候一切自认为能触及的可能性，一点点推倒，碾碎，最后化为齑粉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "然后我们就到了这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "我能留住坎伯兰家的荣耀吗？艾尔希，早就不可能了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "我已经是现在的阿勒黛了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家艾尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_658_1",
      "text": "......可就算是您，也不知道将来的阿勒黛会在哪里，对吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "将来......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家艾尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_658_1",
      "text": "我老啦，小姐，就算现在真的有机会操起乐器，也弹不出什么悦耳的曲子了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家艾尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_658_1",
      "text": "可是，小姐，您答应过我的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家艾尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_658_1",
      "text": "或许，您觉得那只是小时候的戏言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家艾尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_658_1",
      "text": "但我至今都相信，您可以做到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家艾尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_658_1",
      "text": "成为比查尔斯·林奇更伟大的蒸汽骑士，成为比您的先祖更伟大的蒸汽骑士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家艾尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_658_1",
      "text": "您会让我看到的，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "艾尔希！行了！她不会允许......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家艾尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_658_1",
      "text": "那么，您想怎么做呢，小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家艾尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_658_1",
      "text": "无论您的决定是什么，我都会一如既往地支持您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家艾尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_658_1",
      "text": "我不会催促您，您总能做出正确的决定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家艾尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_658_1",
      "text": "小姐......请再让我巡视一次这片花园吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家艾尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_658_1",
      "text": "就算只是些往日的碎片......它仍是我最珍视的东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿勒黛还想说些什么，但终究没有开口 。\n她看着自出生起就与她朝夕相伴的这个人走向花园深处。她们一起度过了最艰难的时光，她们都已被岁月改变成了从未设想过的样子。\n阿勒黛突然意识到，她也已经很久没见过这样笑着的艾尔希了。\n她突然感觉到了从心底涌上的，久违的平静。\n如果她仍有机会——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "突然，阿勒黛的视线被远处一抹跳动的橙红色吸引了。\n那抹橙红色正迅速放大，她感觉到空气在升温。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿勒黛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_397_1",
      "text": "艾尔希，快，我们要——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "顷刻间，整个公爵府陷入一片火海。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱托中校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_649_1",
      "text": "......大君。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "text": "安静。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "text": "你吵到我欣赏这片美景了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "text": "一段段曾经绚烂的历史正在化作飞灰。贵族们骄傲的宅院成为灼焦的朽骸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "text": "花了数百年的时间精心雕琢过的砖瓦一片片剥落。从大地的各个角落搜集培育的花卉蜷曲着死去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱托中校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_649_1",
      "text": "......我之前收到的命令是，审查这些贵族。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "text": "这么说，我的行动让你不满意了，“指挥官”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "text": "你不喜欢这些焰火吗？你对血液汽化的声音没兴趣吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "text": "“嗞嗞，嗞嗞”，试着去听它们，去品味它们，莱托，我的朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "血魔大君",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "text": "我在尽职尽责地检查每一滴血呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱托中校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_649_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱托中校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_649_1",
      "text": "我会协助您的审查，确保......不漏过一个叛徒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱托中校",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_649_1",
      "text": "这是我的职责。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
